# Settings > Updates > System packages (report 047 P3, apt LIST ONLY), the Pi 4 B's capture of the P0 checks (21 updates): the
# Updates page with its two new rows (System packages "21 updates" in amber, App updates "2 updates"), then the System
# packages page: "Refresh lists" (the lists' age, the action dot), the sections "Safe to upgrade (16)", "Launcher
# libraries (4)" (libbrotli1, curl, libcurl4t64, ca-certificates: the launcher's own library and the tool it runs), "Kernel,
# firmware and boot (1)" (rpi-eeprom: a row that opens the page with the command to run in a terminal) and "On this board"
# (grey information: automatic updates). A package row: its name, "old > new" in grey, the grey information dot, no
# action. The status line: upgrading from here comes later, the terminal now. Keys only.
# Review only: no golden; the headers are checked against the home grid's.
title updates system packages
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800 480x320
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS catalogue
env M5APPSTORE_STATE_DIR /nonexistent/harness-appstore
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-01
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.9.1 release arm64
update answer releases-real.json
apt board pi4b
apt lists-age 1
home
header home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
shot updates_system_root
expect_text "21 updates"
expect_color "21 updates" F0B400
expect_chevron "Packages" yes
expect_chevron "App updates" yes
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot updates_system_list
header updates_system_list "Settings > Updates > Packages" "Updates > Packages" "Packages"
expect_text "Refresh lists"
# a package row: grey value, the grey information dot, no chevron and no action
key DOWN
shot updates_system_package
expect_chevron "cifs-utils" no
# the end of the list: the boot chain row (rpi-eeprom) opens the terminal command page
key END
key UP
shot updates_system_end
expect_chevron "rpi-eeprom" yes
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_system_terminal
header updates_system_terminal "Settings > Updates > Packages > Terminal" "Updates > Packages > Terminal" "Packages > Terminal" Terminal
key ESC
wait 300
shot updates_system_back
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
